            "text": "[{\"year\":2024,\"modules\":[{\"module_number\":1,\"courses\":[{\"id\":982,\"title\":\"From Zero to Hero\",\"code\":\"HTE401BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2024-08-19\",\"end_date\":\"2024-09-06\",\"program\":{\"id\":7,\"name\":\"High-tech Entrepreneurship\",\"code\":\"HTE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BKK\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Business Administration\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Open.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":1,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":87,\"feedback\":\"-\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Kamran Elahian\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2768\\/conversions\\/596-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Founder & Chairman at Global Innovation Catalyst\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":2,\"courses\":[{\"id\":989,\"title\":\"Basics of Databases\",\"code\":\"CS202BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2024-09-09\",\"end_date\":\"2024-09-27\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":2,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":95,\"feedback\":\"Hi Aung! Glad to see you on the course - thank you for the participation in our discussions, I really appreciate it! And your final project is impressive also.  I\\u2019m sure you have excellent career prospects\\u2014whether in IT or other fields where you can apply your skills to achieve success. You know, the most exciting things today are happening at the intersection of different areas of knowledge and skills. I wish you all the best, and hope to see you again!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Serhii Denysov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2672\\/conversions\\/437-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Lecturer at Kyiv National Taras Shevchenko University\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":3,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1000,\"title\":\"Calculus 1\",\"code\":\"Math103BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2024-09-30\",\"end_date\":\"2024-10-18\",\"program\":{\"id\":24,\"name\":\"Maths as a Second Language\",\"code\":\"Math\",\"degree\":\"Foundation\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":60,\"credits_for_major\":0,\"credits_for_minor\":0,\"tuition_fee\":11900,\"description\":null,\"title\":null},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Interactive.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":3,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":72,\"feedback\":\"Great progress! Your hard work and effort to keep up with the class have really paid off. Keep pushing forward\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Mohammad Sanaee Namaghi\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3215\\/conversions\\/587-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Data Scientist at B.Grimm Power\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":4,\"courses\":[{\"id\":994,\"title\":\"Intro to Programming 2: Python\",\"code\":\"CS104BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2024-10-21\",\"end_date\":\"2024-11-08\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Venture.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":4,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":100,\"feedback\":\"Congratulations on your outstanding performance in this course! Your ability to consistently excel is commendable, and I hope the knowledge you\\u2019ve gained here will help you in the future at some point :)\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Vetit Kanjaras\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3133\\/conversions\\/352-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"AI Engineer at SKY ICT PCL\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":5,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1020,\"title\":\"Combinatorics & Graphs\",\"code\":\"Math105BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2024-11-11\",\"end_date\":\"2024-11-29\",\"program\":{\"id\":24,\"name\":\"Maths as a Second Language\",\"code\":\"Math\",\"degree\":\"Foundation\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":60,\"credits_for_major\":0,\"credits_for_minor\":0,\"tuition_fee\":11900,\"description\":null,\"title\":null},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":5,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":86,\"feedback\":\"Wai Lin was extremely involved in the study processes of the course, not just doing all the hometasks without any flaws, but also asking questions, solving in class, etc. Thanks!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Andrey Gavrilyuk\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3014\\/conversions\\/861-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Team leader of the HSE team\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":6,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1027,\"title\":\"Intro to Machine Learning\",\"code\":\"DS206BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"failed\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2024-12-02\",\"end_date\":\"2024-12-20\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":6,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":51,\"feedback\":\"You should invest and plan more time for your homework\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Mikhail Romanov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2783\\/conversions\\/612-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Samsung AI Center Moscow (SAIC Moscow), Researcher, R&D Engineer, Team Leader\\nMoscow Institute on Physics and Technology (MIPT), Expert\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":7,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1048,\"title\":\"From Data to Knowledge: Interpretation, Visualization, Presentation\",\"code\":\"DS307BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-01-13\",\"end_date\":\"2025-01-31\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":7,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":80,\"feedback\":\"Dear Wai, I really appreciate the work you have done in my module (an assisting me during the classes). It has been a enormous pleasure to have you participating of this module. You are a hard-working guy and I have no doubt you have a brilliant professional future ahead. Please, don't hesitate to drop me an email if I can assist you in any way in the future. Also, let me know if you visit Barcelona in the future.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Juan Galeano\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2855\\/conversions\\/685-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Post-doctoral researcher at the National Center of Competence in Research (NCCR), Uni- versit\\u00e9 de Gen\\u00e8ve (UNIGE)\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":8,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1068,\"title\":\"Programming: Kotlin\",\"code\":\"CS208BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-02-03\",\"end_date\":\"2025-02-21\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":8,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":93,\"feedback\":\"Wai Lin, thank you for active participation in the class. I don't have many more comments beyond what I already provided in the project review. Keep up the good work.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Monika Protivova\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3485\\/conversions\\/412ea680-aee9-11ee-b654-255d6a9b83cd-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Software Engineer at CleverFarm\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":9,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1062,\"title\":\"Intro to Web Development\",\"code\":\"CS309BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-02-24\",\"end_date\":\"2025-03-14\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":9,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"Congratulations with your result. You are a very silent but skilled worker. I like the way how you made your application grow almost daily, and that you managed to bring it to a rather polished final project. Your app is pretty complete, and you are aware of the strengths and weaknesses. You manage to reason when further questions are asked, and proved that you have insights in your app structure and architecture. Also really cool that you managed to deploy it on laravel.cloud, which demonstrates that you dare to experiment. I wish you a lot of luck in your next steps, just make sure to look for enough challenges, so that you maximise your potential self-development.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nico Deblauwe\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2790\\/conversions\\/620-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Freelance Full Stack Developer\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":10,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1056,\"title\":\"Algorithms and Data Structures\",\"code\":\"CS210BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-03-17\",\"end_date\":\"2025-04-04\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":10,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":98,\"feedback\":\"Very good result. Solved most of Home Assignments and answered the exam perfectly.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Ivan Solomatin\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3258\\/conversions\\/064abfd0-c4c1-11ed-ac18-61342f1280cc-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Leading Engineer at Samsung R&D Institute Russia.\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":11,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1148,\"title\":\"Fundamentals of Blockchain\",\"code\":\"CS411BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-04-28\",\"end_date\":\"2025-05-16\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":11,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":93,\"feedback\":\"Great project! Thank you. \\n\\nTaking off some points because of progress and project management.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Bulat Nasrulin\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3517\\/conversions\\/17cfbf30-b6ef-11ee-a12a-17ac32f29c48-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"PostDoc Researcher Distributed Systems at TU Delft\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":12,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1155,\"title\":\"Intro to Deep Learning\",\"code\":\"DS212BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"incomplete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-05-19\",\"end_date\":\"2025-06-06\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"12:30:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":12,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":null,\"feedback\":null},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Mikhail Romanov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2783\\/conversions\\/612-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Samsung AI Center Moscow (SAIC Moscow), Researcher, R&D Engineer, Team Leader\\nMoscow Institute on Physics and Technology (MIPT), Expert\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":13,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1138,\"title\":\"Unity Game Development\",\"code\":\"CS213\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-30\",\"end_date\":\"2025-07-18\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Hyper.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":13,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":71,\"feedback\":\"Active participation despite remote connection to classes. Good final project.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Anton Baranov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3565\\/conversions\\/2b05fdc0-169d-11ef-a9d5-6512d38ed8ec-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"CTO at EnterAR LLP\"}]},{\"id\":1162,\"title\":\"Engineering and MLOps practices for Modern AI\",\"code\":\"DS313BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-09\",\"end_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":13,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"Aung is a patient engineer and an exceptional team player who demonstrated remarkable dedication throughout the course. He contributed significantly to his project's success, especially when his teammate was absent, showing reliability and leadership when needed. \\n\\nAung is smart with strong attention to detail and excellent listening skills, making him highly effective in collaborative environments. He remained actively engaged during class discussions and consistently provided thoughtful contributions. His combination of technical competence, patience, collaborative spirit, and strong communication skills earned him very positive feedback and makes him an ideal candidate for team-based engineering roles.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Mikhail Rozhkov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3566\\/conversions\\/14f3d0c0-3ac5-11ef-845d-bf9f2d9fa3d0-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Co-Founder of Machine Learning REPA Community and ML REPA School\"}]},{\"id\":1161,\"title\":\"Linear Algebra 1\",\"code\":\"Math113BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"audit\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":false,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-09\",\"end_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"program\":{\"id\":24,\"name\":\"Maths as a Second Language\",\"code\":\"Math\",\"degree\":\"Foundation\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":60,\"credits_for_major\":0,\"credits_for_minor\":0,\"tuition_fee\":11900,\"description\":null,\"title\":null},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":13,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":null,\"feedback\":null},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Mikhail Romanov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2783\\/conversions\\/612-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Samsung AI Center Moscow (SAIC Moscow), Researcher, R&D Engineer, Team Leader\\nMoscow Institute on Physics and Technology (MIPT), Expert\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":14,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1142,\"title\":\"WebGL in Practice\",\"code\":\"FE414\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-07-21\",\"end_date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Hyper.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":14,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":91,\"feedback\":\"Positively surprised on how you had some real progress on the topic itself, especially on how hard you push the final one looking to new features (onBeforeCompile) and the effort you have put in the final project. Too bad tho you were online, would have been better to have you IRL because pretty sure you could have add a positive boost to everyone.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Roberto Borghesi\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3282\\/conversions\\/aa567110-e1ee-11ed-9fb0-31f3f9ae8c3a-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Freelance Creative Frontend Developer\"}]}]}]},{\"year\":2025,\"modules\":[{\"module_number\":1,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1176,\"title\":\"Intro to Cyber Security\",\"code\":\"CSEC201BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-08-18\",\"end_date\":\"2025-09-05\",\"program\":{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Cyber Security\",\"code\":\"CSEC\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Interactive.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":1,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":89,\"feedback\":\"Thank you for your active work, I hope the course was useful.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Sergey Gordeychik\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3839\\/conversions\\/d8bcfb50-50b3-11ea-9480-c3e4cdf53b36-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Product Director for Cyber Network Defense, DarkMatter\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":2,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1218,\"title\":\"Python Refresher for Masters\",\"code\":\"DS402\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"failed\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-09-29\",\"end_date\":\"2025-10-17\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Cyber.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":2,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":28,\"feedback\":\"- (if you see this it means system didn't see the final exam, but to fill in the grades one have to write something in this field, if you think this is the error please contact the staff)\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Maxim Musin\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2865\\/conversions\\/696-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Head of ML at Traceair Technologies\"}]},{\"id\":1182,\"title\":\"Fundamentals of Data Engineering\",\"code\":\"CS402BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-09-08\",\"end_date\":\"2025-09-26\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":2,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":97,\"feedback\":\"You now have the skills to move from raw data chaos to meaningful insights - basically a superpower. Keep honing it and you\\u2019ll stand out anywhere. Welcome to data engineering and good luck!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nikolay Markov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3335\\/conversions\\/6c671940-2ca8-11ee-ab95-455a0028aa8c-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Principal Data Infrastructure Architect at Aligned Research Group\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":3,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1222,\"title\":\"Advanced JavaScript and TypeScript\",\"code\":\"FE403\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-10-20\",\"end_date\":\"2025-11-07\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Cyber.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":3,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":85,\"feedback\":\"Great code and code organization. Hope to see you in December.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Christopher Baker\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3767\\/conversions\\/Christopher-Baker_cut-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1187,\"title\":\"Introduction to Computer Networking\",\"code\":\"CSEC203BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-09-29\",\"end_date\":\"2025-10-17\",\"program\":{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Cyber Security\",\"code\":\"CSEC\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":3,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":100,\"feedback\":\"You've definitely mastered all concepts and skills covered by the module.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Anton Topchiy\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3253\\/conversions\\/942ba360-c1b0-11ed-9bd6-99d24a6f38b4-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Senior Backend Developer at Byrd\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":4,\"courses\":[]},{\"module_number\":5,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1238,\"title\":\"Designing Apps and APIs\",\"code\":\"FE405\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-12-01\",\"end_date\":\"2025-12-19\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Cyber.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":5,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"We're looking for the business problem and the business solution. You've described the issues that their current system has, but why does your system do what they need it todo?\\nSimilarly, what are the risks of the product, not just the technical risks?\\nGood addition with \\\"The Future\\\"!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Christopher Baker\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3767\\/conversions\\/Christopher-Baker_cut-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1200,\"title\":\"Android Development\",\"code\":\"CS405BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-11-10\",\"end_date\":\"2025-11-28\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":5,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":100,\"feedback\":\"Highest score in the course, keep it up! Attention to details, active participation in lectures, homework submitted ahead of time, beautiful design, good technical solutions. If you continue to work in the same spirit, you will achieve great success in IT.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Bulat Mukhutdinov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3570\\/conversions\\/8d6ff720-5954-11ef-8df0-e5e4ac5f1907-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Principal Android Engineer at inDrive\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":6,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1275,\"title\":\"Modern Web Application 2 - From MVP to Deployed App\",\"code\":\"CS406\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-01-12\",\"end_date\":\"2026-01-30\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Interactive.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":6,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"Your presentation was excellent and exceptionally well-prepared, showcasing a highly polished and complete application. You demonstrated outstanding mastery of the subject matter, reasoning skillfully through questions about extending and improving your work. Your thorough understanding and attention to detail made the presentation a true pleasure to experience. The main features were clearly highlighted, reflecting both technical expertise and thoughtful implementation. Additionally, I know it is not easy to be the only remote participant, so congrats once again!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nico Deblauwe\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2790\\/conversions\\/620-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Freelance Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1206,\"title\":\"DevOps\",\"code\":\"DS406BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-12-01\",\"end_date\":\"2025-12-19\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":6,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":100,\"feedback\":\"Wai Lin Aung is one of the top performers in the class. \\n\\nHis passion to the homelab exploration lead him to pass exam and home assignments effortlessly. \\n\\nKeep it up!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Maksym Prokopov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2815\\/conversions\\/645-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Cloud Chief Architect\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":7,\"courses\":[]},{\"module_number\":8,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1287,\"title\":\"React Web\",\"code\":\"FE408\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-02-23\",\"end_date\":\"2026-03-13\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Hyper.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":8,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":96,\"feedback\":\"Great job on the finals! Hope to see you in React Native!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Christopher Baker\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3767\\/conversions\\/Christopher-Baker_cut-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1255,\"title\":\"Mathematical Foundations of Computing\",\"code\":\"CS108BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-02-02\",\"end_date\":\"2026-02-20\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":8,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":77,\"feedback\":\"Hi Aung! Maybe this was not your best possible grade here - but I see that you can do math and algorithms well, and you will surely be able to learn and develop any related skills if you need them for an interesting project! Good luck!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Serhii Denysov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2672\\/conversions\\/437-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Lecturer at Kyiv National Taras Shevchenko University\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":9,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1263,\"title\":\"Data Storages\",\"code\":\"CS409BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-02-23\",\"end_date\":\"2026-03-13\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":9,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":88,\"feedback\":\"Wai Lin Aung was the member of \\\"\\\"TICKET_ANALYTICS\\\"\\\" project,  quite interesting.  Their project was intersting as an idea, but very simple in implementation, comparing with another projects. He sometimes participated in discussions in class, with some interesing opinions. He got great quiz results, so I suppose he got the best level of understanding of data storages.... And I suppose he forgot to hand on his 4-th task.\\r\\n quiz correct answers:54\\r\\n tasks 1:100, 2:100, 3:90, 4:0 \\r\\n participation:50\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nikolay Golov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2806\\/conversions\\/636-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Head of Data Platform at ManyChat\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":10,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1267,\"title\":\"Fundamentals of Operating Systems\",\"code\":\"CSEC210BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-03-16\",\"end_date\":\"2026-04-03\",\"program\":{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Cyber Security\",\"code\":\"CSEC\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":10,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":64,\"feedback\":\"Good potential but inconsistent results.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Konstanin Yegupov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2814\\/conversions\\/644-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Software Engineer at Modeldrive\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":11,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1319,\"title\":\"Integrated Data Engineering and Analysis on Google Cloud Platform\",\"code\":\"DS411BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"registered\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":false,\"start_date\":\"2026-04-27\",\"end_date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":