cal competence, patience, collaborative spirit, and strong communication skills earned him very positive feedback and makes him an ideal candidate for team-based engineering roles.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Mikhail Rozhkov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3566\\/conversions\\/14f3d0c0-3ac5-11ef-845d-bf9f2d9fa3d0-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Co-Founder of Machine Learning REPA Community and ML REPA School\"}]},{\"id\":1161,\"title\":\"Linear Algebra 1\",\"code\":\"Math113BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"audit\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":false,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-09\",\"end_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"program\":{\"id\":24,\"name\":\"Maths as a Second Language\",\"code\":\"Math\",\"degree\":\"Foundation\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":60,\"credits_for_major\":0,\"credits_for_minor\":0,\"tuition_fee\":11900,\"description\":null,\"title\":null},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":13,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":null,\"feedback\":null},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Mikhail Romanov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2783\\/conversions\\/612-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Samsung AI Center Moscow (SAIC Moscow), Researcher, R&D Engineer, Team Leader\\nMoscow Institute on Physics and Technology (MIPT), Expert\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":14,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1142,\"title\":\"WebGL in Practice\",\"code\":\"FE414\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-07-21\",\"end_date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Hyper.Spa