h (NCCR), Uni- versit\\u00e9 de Gen\\u00e8ve (UNIGE)\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":8,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1068,\"title\":\"Programming: Kotlin\",\"code\":\"CS208BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-02-03\",\"end_date\":\"2025-02-21\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":8,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":93,\"feedback\":\"Wai Lin, thank you for active participation in the class. I don't have many more comments beyond what I already provided in the project review. Keep up the good work.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Monika Protivova\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3485\\/conversions\\/412ea680-aee9-11ee-b654-255d6a9b83cd-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Software Engineer at CleverFarm\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":9,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1062,\"title\":\"Intro to Web Development\",\"code\":\"CS309BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-02-24\",\"end_date\":\"2025-03-14\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":9,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"Congratulations with your result. You are a very silent but skilled worker. I like the way how you made your application grow almost daily, and that you managed to bring it to a rather polished final project. Your app is pretty complete, and you are aware of the strengths and weaknesses. You manage to reason when further questions are asked, and proved that you have insights in your app structure and architecture. Also really cool that you managed to deploy it on laravel.cloud, which demonstrates that you dare to experiment. I wish you a lot of luck in your next steps, just make sure to look for enough challenges, so that you maximise your potential self-development.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nico Deblauwe\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2790\\/conversions\\/620-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Freelance Full Stack Developer\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":10,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1056,\"title\":\"Algorithms and Data Structures\",\"code\":\"CS210BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-03-17\",\"end_date\":\"2025-04-04\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2024\",\"module_number\":10,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":98,\"feedback\":\"Very good result. Solved most of Home Assignments and answered the exam perfectly.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Ivan Solomatin\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3258\\/conversions\\/064abfd0-c4c1-11ed-ac18-61342f1280cc-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Leading Engineer at Samsung R&D Institute Russia.\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":11,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1148,\"title\":\"Fundamentals of Blockchain\",\"code\":\"CS411BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-04-28\",\"end_date\":\"2025