echnical solutions. If you continue to work in the same spirit, you will achieve great success in IT.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Bulat Mukhutdinov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3570\\/conversions\\/8d6ff720-5954-11ef-8df0-e5e4ac5f1907-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Principal Android Engineer at inDrive\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":6,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1275,\"title\":\"Modern Web Application 2 - From MVP to Deployed App\",\"code\":\"CS406\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-01-12\",\"end_date\":\"2026-01-30\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Interactive.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":6,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"Your presentation was excellent and exceptionally well-prepared, showcasing a highly polished and complete application. You demonstrated outstanding mastery of the subject matter, reasoning skillfully through questions about extending and improving your work. Your thorough understanding and attention to detail made the presentation a true pleasure to experience. The main features were clearly highlighted, reflecting both technical expertise and thoughtful implementation. Additionally, I know it is not easy to be the only remote participant, so congrats once again!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nico Deblauwe\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2790\\/conversions\\/620-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Freelance Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1206,\"title\":\"DevOps\",\"code\":\"DS406BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":t